&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Company:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faraday Future is a California-based technology company focused on the design, engineering, and development of intelligent, connected electric vehicles and related artificial intelligence–enabled technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014, the Company&#39;s mission is to disrupt the automotive and technology industries by creating user-centric, technology-first experiences. The Company, together with its controlled subsidiaries, operates across multiple technology-driven areas, including AI electric vehicles, robotics, and its crypto business (AIXC), all under its upgraded Global EAI Industry Bridge Strategy, marking the beginning of a new chapter in AI mobility and Web3 integration. The Company aims to leverage the latest technologies and world&#39;s best talent to realize exciting new possibilities across all of these lines. Faraday Future&#39;s automotive business exemplifies its vision for luxury, innovation, and performance, while its FX strategy aims to introduce mass production models equipped with state-of-the-art luxury technology derived from the FF brand, targeted towards a broader market with middle-to-low price range offerings. FF is committed to redefining mobility through AI innovation. Join us in shaping the future of intelligent transportation and technology by creating something new, something connected, and something with a true global impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data-Driven Growth Specialist will join Faraday Future&#39;s Content Commerce Center, owning the full data-to-revenue path across GEO search authority, paid digital marketing and performance media, full-funnel conversion, and AI-powered growth automation. This role is responsible for turning every traffic source — paid digital, organic, social, and LLM-driven — into measurable qualified leads and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role, not a manager role. The Specialist operates as a high-leverage growth function — designing systems, shipping automations, and compounding AI-augmented workflows rather than coordinating headcount. The bar is leverage, not scale of team. Every manual task done twice becomes an automation; every automation compounds into FF&#39;s growth operating system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;GEO Search Authority:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Own Faraday Future&#39;s answer share inside Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and emerging LLM-powered search surfaces. Deploy and maintain llms.txt, 100+ FAQ structured data, JSON-LD schema graphs, and a canonical content library that LLMs preferentially cite. Monitor citation share weekly and ship content fixes within 72 hours of any loss in priority prompts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Paid Digital Marketing &amp;amp; Performance Media&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;Plan, execute, and optimize full-funnel paid digital marketing across TikTok, Meta, YouTube, LinkedIn, programmatic display, and emerging AI-native ad surfaces. Operate TikTok ACA with daily creative rotation, drive LinkedIn ABM (Thought Leader Ads, Document Ads) for B2B targets, and own landing-page CRO across the ROI calculator, deposit cart, and lead-capture flows. Manage media budgets, bidding strategies, and audience targeting end-to-end. Performance is measured in CPL and CAC, not impressions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Full-Funnel User Growth:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Grow qualified leads from low baseline to 1,000+ per month through programmatic experimentation, cohort and LTV analysis, and matrix-scale distribution. Run a minimum of 20 documented growth experiments per quarter with public win-loss logs so every learning compounds into the team&#39;s playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;AI Workflow &amp;amp; Agent Engineering:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain the systems that allow one operator to do the work of ten. Develop and version a Claude / GPT / Gemini prompt library covering market research, copywriting, creative ideation, competitor monitoring, and dashboard generation. Architect n8n / Make pipelines connecting ad platforms, CRM, analytics, and Slack. Use Claude Code and MCP servers to automate reporting, anomaly detection, and brand-safety content audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Data Infrastructure &amp;amp; Attribution:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Build and own the closed-loop attribution model connecting GA4, TikTok Pixel, Meta CAPI, LinkedIn Conversions API, and the company CRM. Maintain live dashboards that surface ROI down to the single ad-creative level. Replace weekly slide decks with always-on data products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Lead Engine Operations:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Operate the OpenClaw + ManyChat + AI scoring stack with the AI Workflow Center to achieve sub-10-minute lead capture, sub-5-minute scoring, and sub-30-minute dealer dispatch. Continuously calibrate lead scoring models, dealer dispatch rules, and AI SDR handoffs in partnership with the Sales Conversion team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with the Global Social Media Center (GSMC) on social-sourced leads and Owner-aligned content for paid amplification; with the Visual Creative Center (VCC) on conversion creative briefs and asset-library feedback loops; with the Matrix &amp;amp; KOC team on systematic scale-out of winning creative across the matrix network; and with the AI Workflow Center on co-owned engineering of growth automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Compounding Leverage &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Document prompts, agents, dashboards, and playbooks in a continuously versioned Growth OS. Train other team members on AI-augmented workflows. Treat every manual repetition as a defect — automate or systematize on the second occurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
