&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Education:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Computer Science, Statistics, Economics, or a related field. Advanced degree a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
