&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tool Fluency:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Working command of n8n / Make / Zapier, GA4, Google Tag Manager, HubSpot or Salesforce, a data warehouse (BigQuery, Snowflake, or equivalent), and a BI tool (Looker, Metabase, or Hex).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;SQL is required. Working-level Python or JavaScript for scripting and lightweight integrations. Comfortable reading API documentation and shipping a working third-party integration end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Experimentation Discipline:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to design, run, and document a high volume of growth experiments with clear hypotheses, success criteria, and shareable learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Bilingual:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Strong proficiency in both English and Mandarin Chinese, both verbal and written, with the ability to translate complex product and technical messaging into clear, conversion-friendly content for CN and US audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
