&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design: Architect a modular and scalable robotics tooling portfolio that&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;simulation, hardware-in-the-loop, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
