&lt;li&gt;HDF5, LeRobot) and communication protocols across the AI lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering &amp;amp; Pipeline Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multimodal Alignment: Lead the development of automated tools for multi-sensor data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fusion and precision timestamp alignment (LiDAR, Camera, IMU, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
