&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Your Role:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking for &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; AI Automation Intern&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a seat for a technically-minded student who is excited about AI and wants to apply it inside a real public-company finance team. You’ll use AI tools (and some simple code where it helps) to speed up the repetitive parts of finance, and get real exposure to the company’s capital-markets and funding activity. You don’t need a finance background — we’ll teach you the finance. What matters most is that you’re comfortable with technology, genuinely curious about AI, and eager to learn and build.&lt;/p&gt;
