&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Support core finance work as you learn it — financial analysis, reporting, reconciliations, and month-end data preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Markets: &lt;/strong&gt;Help track equity financing (e.g., committed equity / ELOC), convertible instruments, and financing timelines; support cap-table, dilution, and funding trackers and investor / IR materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct market, peer, and investor research (accelerated with AI) and prepare clean, well-sourced summaries for the finance and IR teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
