&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Aptitude (primary focus): &lt;/strong&gt;Strong aptitude for and genuine interest in AI and technology; comfortable going beyond chatting with AI — some exposure to basic coding (e.g., Python) or building simple automations through coursework, class projects, or personal projects. You don’t need professional experience; curiosity and a willingness to learn matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
