&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a build-and-improve environment; self-directed with strong ownership mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — ability to explain financial analysis clearly to non-finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
