&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build deep partnerships with priority platforms to access creator funds, livestream slots, ad credits, and new commerce surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
