&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Offer Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinate with Ecommerce, Brand, and Finance on content-only offers, bundles, and live-room exclusives, protecting brand integrity and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Establish a content commerce measurement system covering GMV, conversion rate, content ROI, and creator unit economics.&lt;/li&gt;
