&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bachelor’s degree in marketing, communications, business, or related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Demonstrated ability to scale a livestream or creator-led channel to meaningful GMV at premium ASP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator Network:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Existing relationships with creators, MCNs, and platform partner teams in priority markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Sense:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Strong instinct for product storytelling, demo design, and content formats that convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Experience leading multi-disciplinary teams across production, talent, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
