&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faraday Future (FF) is a California-based technology company focused on the design, engineering, and development of intelligent, connected electric vehicles and related artificial intelligence–enabled technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FF is committed to redefining mobility through AI innovation. Join us in shaping the future of intelligent transportation and technology by creating something new, something connected, and something with a true global impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Social Content Production Specialist&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;will join Faraday Future&#39;s MarCom &amp;amp; Video Sales team, primarily responsible for day-to-day social content shooting and production, on-site production support for small-to-mid size projects, and centralized management of the company&#39;s shooting equipment. The role also provides dotted-line support to the Social Operations and Content Commerce teams on selected execution tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time on-site role based in the United States, requiring daily in-office presence. Fluency in English and Chinese is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Content Shooting &amp;amp; Production:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shoot and produce social media content, including photo and short-form video assets across portrait, product, and event scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Small-to-Mid Size Project Planning &amp;amp; Execution:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Plan and execute small-to-mid size projects end to end — from requirement scoping and scheduling to on-site delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Assistant (AC) Duties:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Support photographers/directors with equipment prep, on-set execution, and footage handoff/archiving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Equipment Management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Own centralized management of the company&#39;s shooting equipment (cameras, lenses, lighting, audio), including check-in/check-out, maintenance, and scheduling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Operations Support (Dotted Line):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Support the Social Operations team with content publishing schedules and tracking/consolidating private-domain (owned-channel) leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Commerce Support (Dotted Line):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Support the Content Commerce team with sales lead tracking and conversion records, and assist with basic digital marketing execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Archiving:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Maintain organized archiving of raw footage and deliverables per company standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;1+ years of hands-on photography/videography experience, able to independently shoot photo and short-form video content across portrait, product, and event scenarios; 1+ years of experience in video production, photography assistance, or social content creation (internship experience counts).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Film, Media, Marketing, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipment Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on operation and basic maintenance skills for camera, lighting, and audio equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Familiarity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with content publishing workflows on major social platforms (TikTok, Instagram, Xiaohongshu, Douyin).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and Chinese; able to operate in cross-cultural environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to work on-site in Los Angeles, CA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in automotive, robotics, or advanced technology industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic video editing skills (Premiere / DaVinci Resolve).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lead tracking (CRM tools) or basic digital marketing exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior hands-on experience as a production assistant / AC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks + Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare + dental + vision benefits (Free for you/discounted for family)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Casual dress code + relaxed work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culturally diverse, progressive atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Soul of Faraday” community outreach team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
